					"nextDialogs": [
						150080402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瑪拉妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080402,
					"content": "這是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080403,
					"content": "這是我們進入鰭游龍聚會的鑰匙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瑪拉妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080404,
					"content": "如果鰭游龍的嗅覺也十分敏銳，那麼即便我們努力隱藏腳步聲、躲避視線，只要一靠近還是會被發現。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瑪拉妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080405,
					"content": "而這種植物正好可以解決這種問題，因為它的氣味很接近鰭游龍的體味。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瑪拉妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080406,
					"content": "用它提取一些汁液塗抹在身上，就可以騙過鰭游龍的鼻子了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瑪拉妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080407,
					"content": "要塗在身上啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080408,
					"content": "沒關係，這其實有美容效果的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瑪拉妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080409,
					"content": "瑪拉妮採集了一些汁液，替每個人都穿上一層氣味的偽裝。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080410
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150080410,
					"content": "嗯…濕濕滑滑的，聞起來的確很像鰭游龍呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080411,
					"content": "完美，我們再去試一下吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "瑪拉妮"
				}
			]
